041372             0101*   ; 4	Invert the on-screen pixel
041372             0102*   ; 5	No operation
041372             0103*   ; 6	AND the inverse of the specified colour with the on-screen pixel
041372             0104*   ; 7	OR the inverse of the specified colour with the on-screen pixel
