04218A CA 96 21 04 0084*       jp z,@F ; player is dead so don't check for collisions
04218E CD 10 20 04 0085*       call check_enemy_collision_player
042192 CA B6 21 04 0086*       jp z,@player
042196             0087*   @@:
042196 CD 04 20 04 0088*       call check_enemy_collision_laser
04219A CA AE 21 04 0089*       jp z,@laser
